  "preview": {
    "tag": "main-d22e458",
    "title": "fix(audio): avoid InputStream.readAllBytes() for Android 12 compatibility",
    "summary": "In PulseAudioComponent.java, pactl() calls InputStream.readAllBytes(). While available in desktop Java 9+, on Android this method was only introduced in API level 33 (Android 13)).\nSince DroidDeck targets minSdkVersion 26, devices on Android 12 or earlier (API 26\u201332, such as the LG V50s ThinQ) crash when starting a session:\nFATAL EXCEPTION: pulse-sink-guard\njava.lang.NoSuchMethodError: No virtual method readAllBytes()[B in class Ljava/io/InputStream;\nat com.droiddeck.launcher.audio.PulseAudioComponent.pactl(PulseAudioComponent.java:227)",
    "commit": "d22e458d642a4f093eb7a3f44ca242b12959caf8",
