    {
      "commit": "9743ac3abc0aaf4632b8af9f6aa9e44e43290d8c",
      "title": "Windows components: leave out the OpenAL setup program, a twin of the DLL copy that installs here",
      "summary": "oalinst runs OpenAL's NSIS setup, which only copies OpenAL32 and wrapoal; oalinstdll copies the same DLLs and installs here. The setup entry joins the list the page leaves out. With the catalog's 15 recordings, the waiting section now holds WebView2 alone. The catalog is untouched.",
      "publishedAt": 1791653969000
